        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "买蔬菜",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "阿姨，这个茄子、苦瓜、丝瓜、豇豆都怎么卖的？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "顾客"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "茄子和豇豆还有丝瓜是3元一斤，苦瓜要贵点4元一斤。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "阿姨"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "那请你每样帮我称一斤，看看一共多少钱？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "顾客"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "总共13块，给现金还是扫码支付？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "阿姨"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "扫码吧，谢谢阿姨。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "顾客"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "不客气。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-06-29-buying-vegetables_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "阿姨"
        }
      ]
    },
